</nav>

<header id="hero">
  <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" class="lb3d-canvas" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;"></canvas>
  <div class="lbhf" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/hero-construction7.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="1200" height="901"></div>
  <div class="lbhf-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="k">Construction & Project Management</p>
      <h1 class="h1">Building properly.<br><em>Every stage.</em></h1>
      <p class="d">Commercial fitouts, residential projects, renovations and project management — delivered with precision from set-out to completion.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn--p" href="#lbq">Get a free quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--o" href="#stages">View our build stages</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-trust">
        <span>Lic 339272C</span>
        <span>ABN 22 126 491 969</span>
        <span>Owner-operator oversight</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <span><b>15+</b>Years experience</span>
        <span><b>200+</b>Projects delivered</span>
        <span><b>$50M+</b>Value managed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec" id="stages" aria-labelledby="stages-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Our build stages</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="stages-t">From set-out to handover</h2>
  <p class="lead">Every JEC project runs the same four checkpoints — set-out, frame, clad, complete — inspected and signed off before the next trade starts.</p>
  <div class="stg">
    <article class="stg__it rv"><p class="stg__n">01</p><h3 class="stg__h">Set-out</h3><p class="stg__p">Survey, levels and layout lines locked in before a single member is cut or fixed.</p></article>
    <article class="stg__it rv"><p class="stg__n">02</p><h3 class="stg__h">Frame</h3><p class="stg__p">Structural framing squared, plumbed and fixed to spec — checked before sheeting.</p></article>
    <article class="stg__it rv"><p class="stg__n">03</p><h3 class="stg__h">Clad</h3><p class="stg__p">Roof and wall cladding sealed and flashed — weatherproof before interior works begin.</p></article>
    <article class="stg__it rv"><p class="stg__n">04</p><h3 class="stg__h">Complete</h3><p class="stg__p">Defects closed out, site cleaned, handover with the paperwork in order.</p></article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div data-ux="marquee" class="ux-strip"><div class="ux-strip__in"><span>Commercial fitouts</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Residential projects</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Renovations</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Project management</span><span class="uxdot">·</span></div></div>


<section class="sec sec--panel" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="cap-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Capabilities</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="cap-t">What we deliver</h2>
  <p class="lead">Four core service pillars - each managed end-to-end with the same rigour.</p>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">Commercial fitouts</h3><p class="svc__p">Office, retail and hospitality fitouts - services coordination, compliance and finish quality on programme.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Residential projects</h3><p class="svc__p">New homes and major renovations - structural to finish, managed with site discipline and clear communication.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Renovations</h3><p class="svc__p">Extensions, remodels and adaptive reuse - integrating new work with existing fabric seamlessly.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Project management</h3><p class="svc__p">Programme control, procurement, quality assurance and stakeholder coordination - single point of accountability.</p></article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="about" aria-labelledby="abt-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Approach</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="abt-t">Precision at every phase</h2>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__art rv">
      <img src="assets/hero-construction4.jpg" alt="JEC Project Group construction site - structural works in progress" loading="eager" width="1200" height="857">
      <p class="about__cap">// ON SITE - JEC PROJECT GROUP, IN PROGRESS</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="about__lis">
      <li class="rv">Every project gets the same layout lines, tolerance checks and pride in a tight joint - from a commercial fitout to a residential renovation.</li>
      <li class="rv">Working clean is non-negotiable: protection down, site managed, finish left ready for the next trade.</li>
      <li class="rv">Clear scopes before work starts - you know what is being built, with what materials, and what it will take.</li>
      <li class="rv">Single-point accountability. Owner-operator oversight, on the tools, accountable for the finish.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="foot" id="foot">
  <div class="foot__in">
    <div>
      <h3>JEC Project Group</h3>
      <p>Commercial fitouts, residential projects, renovations & project management.<br>ABN 22 126 491 969</p>
    </div>
    <div class="foot__meta">
      <p><b>Area</b>Greater Melbourne & regional VIC</p>
      <p><b>Quote</b><a href="#lbq">Request a free quote</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="foot__legal">&copy; <span id="year"></span> JEC Project Group. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

<section id="lbq" aria-labelledby="lbq-h">
<style>
#lbq{--lbq-accent:var(--acc);--lbq-ink:var(--ink);--lbq-muted:var(--mut);--lbq-bg:var(--bg-2);--lbq-panel:var(--panel);--lbq-line:var(--line);padding:72px 20px;background:var(--lbq-bg);color:var(--lbq-ink)}
#lbq *{box-sizing:border-box}
#lbq .lbq-w{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:900px){#lbq .lbq-w{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
#lbq h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-family:var(--font-d)}
#lbq p.lbq-s{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--lbq-muted);max-width:52ch}
#lbq .lbq-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--lbq-line);padding-top:22px}
#lbq .lbq-info div{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
#lbq .lbq-info b{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--acc-dk);min-width:64px}
#lbq .lbq-info a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
#lbq .lbq-f{display:grid;gap:12px;background:var(--lbq-panel);border:1px solid var(--lbq-line);border-radius:14px;padding:26px}
#lbq label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--lbq-muted);margin-bottom:5px}
#lbq input,#lbq textarea,#lbq select{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--lbq-line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:.95rem}
#lbq textarea{min-height:96px;resize:vertical}
#lbq input:focus,#lbq textarea:focus,#lbq select:focus{outline:2px solid var(--lbq-accent);outline-offset:1px;border-color:transparent}
#lbq button{margin-top:6px;padding:13px 22px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--lbq-accent);color:#1a1a1a;font:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:.95rem;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em}
#lbq button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}
#lbq .lbq-st{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--lbq-muted);min-height:1.2em}
#lbq .lbq-cons{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--lbq-muted);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
#lbq .lbq-cons input{width:auto}
#lbq .lbq-hp{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}

/* skip-link hide (fleet) 2026-10-14 */
.skip-link,.skip, .skip-to-content, [class*="skip"]{position:absolute!important;left:-9999px!important;top:auto!important;width:1px!important;height:1px!important;overflow:hidden!important;z-index:10000!important}
.skip-link:focus,[class*="skip"]:focus{left:16px!important;top:16px!important;width:auto!important;height:auto!important;padding:10px 16px!important;background:#111!important;color:#fff!important;border-radius:6px!important;overflow:visible!important}

/* mobile overflow guard 2026-10-14 */
html,body{overflow-x:hidden}
@media (max-width:820px){
  h1,h2,h3,.h1,.hero h1,.sec-title,.k,.kicker,.kick,.eyebrow,.tag-line,.tag,.hero-kicker,.hero-sub,.lead{
    white-space:normal!important;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;max-width:100%!important}
  .hero-kicker,.k,.kicker,.kick,.eyebrow,.tag{font-size:clamp(10px,3.1vw,13px)!important;letter-spacing:.22em!important}
  h1,.h1{font-size:clamp(26px,10.5vw,54px)!important;line-height:1.05!important}
}
</style>
<div class="lbq-w">
  <div>
    <h2 id="lbq-h">Get a free quote</h2>
    <p class="lbq-s">Tell us about the job and we'll come back with a firm price - no surprises, no obligation.</p>
    <div class="lbq-info">
      <div><b>Area</b><span>Greater Melbourne & regional VIC</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form id="lbq-form" novalidate data-site="jec-project-group" data-biz="JEC Project Group">
    <div class="lbq-f">
      <div class="lbq-g">
        <div><label for="lbq-n">Name</label><input id="lbq-n" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div><label for="lbq-p">Phone</label><input id="lbq-p" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
        <div><label for="lbq-e">Email</label><input id="lbq-e" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></div>
        <div class="lbq-full"><label for="lbq-svc">Service</label>
          <select id="lbq-svc" name="service"><option>Commercial fitouts</option><option>Residential projects</option><option>Renovations</option><option>Project management</option><option>Other</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="lbq-full"><label for="lbq-m">Tell us about the job</label><textarea id="lbq-m" name="message" placeholder="Project type, scope, timeline, location…" required></textarea></div>
      </div>
      <label class="lbq-cons"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1" checked> I agree to be contacted about this request.</label>
      <div class="lbq-hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <button type="submit">Send quote request</button>
      <p class="lbq-st" id="lbq-st" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </form>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var EP = null;
  function base(cb){
    if (window.__LAYDBACK_API_BASE) return cb(window.__LAYDBACK_API_BASE);
    var done = false;
    var t = setTimeout(function(){ if(!done){done=true;cb('https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');} }, 2500);
    fetch('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/laydbackapps-beep/48ff985c786b72a1637d7875f4df79b8/raw/api-base.txt?_=' + Date.now())
      .then(function(r){ return r.text(); })
      .then(function(txt){
        var b = (txt||'').trim().replace(/\/+$/, '');
        if (done) return;
        done = true; clearTimeout(t);
        cb(/^https:\/\/[a-z0-9.\-]+(:\d+)?$/i.test(b) ? b : 'https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');
      })
      .catch(function(){ if(!done){done=true;clearTimeout(t);cb('https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');} });
  }
  function init(){
    var f = document.getElementById('lbq-form');
    if (!f) return;
    var st = document.getElementById('lbq-st');
    var btn = f.querySelector('button[type=submit]');
    f.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      var d = {};
      new FormData(f).forEach(function(v,k){ d[k]=v; });
      if (d.website) return;
      if (!d.name || (!d.phone && !d.email) || !(d.message||'').trim()) {
        st.textContent = 'Please add your name, a phone or email, and a few words about the job.';
        st.style.color = '#ff9d8a';
        return;
      }
      btn.disabled = true;
      st.textContent = 'Sending…';
      st.style.color = '';
      base(function(B){
        var url = B + '/functions/v1/quote-request';
        fetch(url, {
          method:'POST',
          headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},
          body: JSON.stringify({
            site_id: f.dataset.site || '',
            business_name: f.dataset.biz || '',
            name: d.name, phone: d.phone, email: d.email,
            service: d.service || '', message: d.message,
            consent: !!d.consent
          })
        })
        .then(function(r){ return r.json().catch(function(){ return {}; }); })
        .then(function(x){
          if (x && x.success) {
            f.reset();
            st.textContent = "Thanks - your request is in. We'll be in touch shortly.";
            st.style.color = 'var(--lbq-accent)';
          } else {
            throw new Error((x && x.error) || 'Could not send');
          }
        })
        .catch(function(err){
          st.textContent = (err && err.message) ? err.message : 'Could not send - please try again or call.';
          st.style.color = '#ff9d8a';
        })
        .finally(function(){ btn.disabled = false; });
      });
    });
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
  else init();
})();
</script>
</section>


<script>
/* ---- page glue (reveal + nav) preserved through the scene retrofit ---- */
(function(){var rvs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.rv'));
if('IntersectionObserver' in window){var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(en){if(en.isIntersecting){en.target.classList.add('on');io.unobserve(en.target);}});},{rootMargin:'0px 0px -12% 0px',threshold:0.08});rvs.forEach(function(el){io.observe(el);});}else{rvs.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on');});}
setTimeout(function(){document.querySelectorAll('.rv:not(.on)').forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on');});},420);
var b=document.getElementById('burger'),n=document.getElementById('navlinks');if(b&&n){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var o=n.classList.toggle('open');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o?'true':'false');});n.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target.tagName==='A')n.classList.remove('open');});}var y=document.getElementById('year');if(y)y.textContent=new Date().getFullYear();})();
</script>



<div class="lb-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<script>/* herocopy-failsafe 2026-10-14 */setTimeout(function(){var hc=document.getElementById('heroCopy')||document.querySelector('.hero-copy');if(hc){var o=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(hc).opacity||'1');if(o<0.08){hc.style.opacity='1';}var guard=0;var t=setInterval(function(){guard++;var oo=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(hc).opacity||'1');if(oo<0.08&&guard<12){hc.style.opacity='1';}if(guard>=12){clearInterval(t);}} ,800);}},900);</script>
</body>
</html>
